#: src/nix-flake.md:1
msgid "Nix Flake"
msgstr ""

#: src/nix-flake.md:3
msgid ""
"The `just` repository includes a [`flake.nix`](https://github.com/casey/just/"
"tree/master/flake.nix) that defines a [nix flake](https://nix.dev/concepts/"
"flakes.html), allowing you to use `just` as an input to another flake:"
msgstr ""

#: src/nix-flake.md:8
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"{\n"
"  inputs = {\n"
"    just.url = \"github:casey/just\";\n"
"  }\n"
"\n"
"  outputs = {self, nixpkgs, just}: {\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
